WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Brother Lin Feng said I did a good job

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,680
What job is done well?

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,920
Isn't it just a bargain?

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,000
Not really

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,440
I cooked the fish for a long time

6
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:11,120
My arms are sore Zhou Ting

7
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,340
You got back half a fish yesterday

8
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,500
Xiaotang moved back to the first floor today

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,400
No matter how Xiaotang did it

10
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,640
In terms of results

11
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,080
Her contribution is greater than yours

12
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:27,860
You have no right to make irresponsible remarks here.

13
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:33,950
There are also sweet potatoes, don’t test too close to sister Weiwei

14
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:36,190
Is it my turn next time?

15
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,720
Things about duty rotation

16
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,120
It's your turn to choose

17
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,910
It takes half a day to turn over a fish and change the house.

18
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:49,780
I figured out two fish in this account

19
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:50,780
a bowl of fruit

20
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:51,740
a sweet potato

21
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:54,900
Saving food can last a whole day for Su Weiwei

22
00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,640
Is it time to share the food? Put it in storage first and then share it with Weiwei tomorrow.

23
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,080
What Xiaotang exchanged for

24
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,240
Explain clearly in person how to distract people's hearts so as to be stable

25
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:05,520
How to divide

26
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:06,600
Two fish is a lot

27
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,040
But there are more than a dozen of us.

28
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:09,680
It’s not me who feels uncomfortable at the end of the division
